.TH SAMPLE-CONFIG-GET 1
.SH NAME
sample\-config\-get \- Reads one key.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsample config get\fR [\fIoptions\fR] \fIstring\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
Reads one key.
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
\fIstring\fR
The key.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-s\fR, \fB\-\-scope\fR \fIstring\fR
Where to look.
Default: user.
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Log more.
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Show help.
.TP
\fB\-\-version\fR
Show version.
